0 !ACHILLES {"id":"ACH-Z01-S02","name":"Zone I · Scene 2: The Cosmic Boss — Earth, Sky, Sea & The Unbathing Bear","zone":"Z01","lines":"18.483–490","greek":"Ἐν μὲν γαῖαν ἔτευξ᾽, ἐν δ᾽ οὐρανόν, ἐν δὲ θάλασσαν, Ἠέλιόν τ᾽ ἀκάμαντα Σελήνην τε πλήθουσαν, ἐν δὲ τὰ τείρεα πάντα, τά τ᾽ οὐρανὸς ἐστεφάνωται, Πληϊάδας θ᾽ Ὑάδας τε τό τε σθένος Ὠρίωνος Ἄρκτον θ᾽, ἣν καὶ Ἄμαξαν ἐπίκλησιν καλέουσιν, ἥ τ᾽ αὐτοῦ στρέφεται καί τ᾽ Ὠρίωνα δοκεύει, οἴη δ᾽ ἄμμορός ἐστι λοετρῶν Ὠκεανοῖο.","buckley":"On it he wrought the earth, and the heaven, and the sea, the unwearied sun, and the full moon; on it also, all the constellations with which the heaven is crowned, the Pleiades, the Hyades, and the might of Orion, and the Bear, which they also call by the appellation of the Wain, which there revolves, and watches Orion; but it alone is without a share of the baths of the ocean.","worldModel":{"vision":"Central golden omphalos dome surrounded by kyanos sky (272), emerald earth (2), golden Sun (297/46), silver full Moon (179), and star-stud constellations (11609).","memory":"Invariance law: The Bear/Wain (Ἄρκτος) revolves perpetually around the polar axis watching Orion, constrained never to dip below the horizon of Oceanus.","controller":"Cosmological clockwork anchoring all mortal time and agricultural seasons in the outer rings."}}

